    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks. One concern from my partners is the actual risk profile. Can you explain why shifting from SMS to hardware keys is safer regarding modern threat actors? We need to justify the cost of the hardware to the senior partners.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
